---
import logofoot from "../assets/logofoot.png";
---

<footer class="w-full bg-[#f5f5f5] px-5 pb-0 pt-4">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] bg-[#0047ff] text-white">
    <div class="relative min-h-[170px] px-6 py-8 sm:px-8">
      <!-- Círculos decorativos -->
      <div class="absolute -bottom-24 left-16 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-teal-300/80"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-28 left-72 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-blue-700/80"></div>
      <div class="absolute -right-16 bottom-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-[#081c44]/70"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.6fr]">
        <!-- Logo -->
        <div>
          <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center">
            <img src={logofoot.src} alt="Loop" class="h-8 w-auto"/>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Links -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4">
          <div>
            <a
              href="/profesores"
              class="mb-3 inline-block rounded-full border border-white px-5 py-1.5 transition hover:bg-white hover:text-[#0047ff]"
            >
              Materias
            </a>

            <ul class="space-y-1 text-white/90">
              <li>Matemática</li>
              <li>Programación</li>
              <li>Física</li>
              <li>Inglés</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <a
              href="/registro-profe"
              class="mb-3 inline-block rounded-full border border-white px-5 py-1.5 transition hover:bg-white hover:text-[#0047ff]"
            >
              Dar clases
            </a>

            <ul class="space-y-1 text-white/90">
              <li>Ganá tokens</li>
              <li>Compartí</li>
              <li>Ayudá</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <a
              href="/profesores#acerca"
              class="mb-3 inline-block rounded-full border border-white px-5 py-1.5 transition hover:bg-white hover:text-[#0047ff]"
            >
              Acerca
            </a>

            <ul class="space-y-1 text-white/90">
              <li>Loop</li>
              <li>UNAB</li>
              <li>Banco de tiempo</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <a
              href="mailto:loop.unab@gmail.com"
              class="mb-3 inline-block rounded-full border border-white px-5 py-1.5 transition hover:bg-white hover:text-[#0047ff]"
            >
              Ayuda
            </a>

            <p class="normal-case text-white/90">
              loop.unab@gmail.com
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="relative z-10 mt-8 text-xs font-semibold text-white/80">
        Loop conecta estudiantes para aprender, enseñar y seguir moviendo tokens.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</footer>
